    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to bring to the market this 2 bedroom 3rd floor apartment. No 19 extends to 60 sq.m (45 sqft). The Abbey apartment complex is located in the popular and mature residential development of Classes Lake in Ovens.  \r\nClasses Lake is ideally positioned within walking distance of Ballincollig Town Centre, Dell/Emc and is within minutes drive of the N22 South Link Road network.   Ballincollig town offers access to a number of primary & secondary schools along with all the other amenities it has to offer including shops, supermarkets, cinema, sports facilities, cafes, bars and restaurants. Viewing highly recommended. The 220 (24 hours ) bus stop is adjacent to the development . \r\nThis complex is managed by a Management Company and has a secure gated entrance, access to the individual blocks is by key fob. \r\n\r\nNo 19 has a B energy rating thus qualifying for a green mortgage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Hallway - \r\nTimber laminate flooring. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living room - 2.7m x 2.2m \r\ntimber laminate flooring, floor and eye level kitchen units, over the counter tiles, plumbed for dishwasher and washing machine and integrated oven and hob.  \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining area: - 4.2m x 3.5m \r\nTimber laminate flooring with double doors to the balcony. \nThere is also a storage press.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: - 3.6m x 2.7m \r\nDouble room with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring. \nEn suite: Floor and wall tiles, electric shower, wc and whb \n\r\n\r\nBedroom2: - 3.4m x 3.3m \r\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - \r\nWall and floor tiling, wc, whb, shower over bath with a heated towel rail.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent location\r\n2 Double bedrooms\r\nParking\r\nGas heating\r\nLift access"
      },
      {
